          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko twebweho bene Data, ubwo twatandukanywaga namwe igihe gito ku mubiri, ariko si ku mutima twiyongeranije kugira umwete wo kubabona, tubakumbura cyane ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko twashakaga kuza iwanyu. (Icyakora jyewe Pawulo sinabishatse rimwe gusa ahubwo ni kabiri), ariko Satani aratubuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibyiringiro byacu ni iki, cyangwa ibyishimo, cyangwa ikamba ryo kwirata? Si mwebwe se mu maso y'Umwami wacu Yesu, ubwo azaza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ari mwe cyubahiro cyacu n'ibyishimo byacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
